I walk over to Priya's desk.
She is working on her computer.
"Hello, Priya," I say to her.
"Hello, Maya."
"Have a seat," she says with a smile.
I want to see the design for the new project.
Priya is a UI designer.
"I have worked in this field for five years," Priya tells me.
"I have prepared the first screens for the project," she says.
She shows me her work.
I look at her monitor.
The design is very beautiful.
"I have chosen these colours for our new app," Priya explains.
"You have done a really great job," I tell her.
"Thank you."
"Now you have to write the code for this," she says.
"Yes, I have understood your design well," I say.
We discuss the upcoming tasks for some time.
I really like working with Priya.
